  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop the red onion and celery. Thinly slice the carrot (unpeeled) into half-moons. Finely chop the garlic (or use a garlic press).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5d6f39a75b4ab900086b8678/step-c6b16ef8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large pot or saucepan, heat a good drizzle of olive oil over a medium-high heat. When the oil is hot, add the onion, celery and carrot and cook, stirring occasionally, until softened, 5-6 minutes. Add a drizzle more olive oil, the garlic, rustic herb spice blend (see ingredients list), a pinch of fennel seeds and a pinch of chilli flakes (if using). Cook, stirring, until fragrant, 2 minutes.\n• TIP: Fennel and chilli are strong flavours, add as much or as little as you like!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5d6f39a75b4ab900086b8678/step-98b76ef1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Pour the red kidney beans (including the liquid!) into the pan with the veggies. Add the diced tomatoes with garlic & olive oil and the water. Crumble in the vegetable stock cubes (2 cubes for 2 people / 4 cubes for 4 people), then add the brown sugar and stir to combine. Simmer until slightly reduced, 15 minutes.\n• TIP: Adding the bean soaking liquid helps to thicken the soup.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5d6f39a75b4ab900086b8678/step-6342b8c9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the soup is simmering, preheat the grill to high. Slice the ciabatta in half and place, cut-side up, on an oven tray. Spread with the basil pesto and sprinkle with the grated Parmesan cheese. When the soup has 5 minutes cook time remaining, place the ciabatta under the grill until the cheese is melted and bubbling, 3-5 minutes.\n• TIP: Keep an eye on the toasts as they can burn fast!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5d6f39a75b4ab900086b8678/step-93e84b56.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Just before serving the soup, add the baby spinach leaves and stir until just wilted.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5d6f39a75b4ab900086b8678/step-f4759c29.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide the Tuscan veggie bean soup between bowls. Serve with the cheesy pesto toasts.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5d6f39a75b4ab900086b8678/step-22daee4c.jpg"
    }
  ]
